==== in-heading
<h2><a name="border1px-solid-redtextborder-1" class="anchor" href="#border1px-solid-redtextborder-1" aria-label="Heading link"></a><div style="border: 1px solid red;" class="bb-border">text</div></h2>
==== around-b
<div style="border: 1px solid red;" class="bb-border"><span class="bbcode-b">text</span></div>
==== in-b
<span class="bbcode-b">before <div style="border: 1px solid red;" class="bb-border">text</div> after</span>
==== in-core-quote
