<blockquote>
<div style="border: 1px solid red;" class="bb-border">text</div>
</blockquote>
</aside>
==== misnested-with-i
<div style="border: 1px solid red;" class="bb-border"><span class="bbcode-i">text</span></div>
tail
==== nested-in-itself
<div style="border: 1px solid red;" class="bb-border">outer <div style="border: 1px solid red;" class="bb-border">inner</div> outer</div>
